From: Codex M2 kgclient account integration
Subject: [PATCH] Restore the donor-pinned vendor_kg account in M2 Hybrid Vendor

Reason: attempt55's SELinux lookup reports UID 5959 as oem_5959, while the
retained donor seapp rule requires vendor_kg for KnoxGuard. The Hybrid Vendor
passwd/group lack the exact A37 donor entries.
Files: G965F M2 runtime compatibility applier/lock, final vendor restore
customizer and actual-ext4 image verifier.
Verification: locked donor hashes/rows, unique UID/GID and name, idempotent
fixture merge, collision rejection, exact final image metadata, source replay
and M2 runtime `id 5959`/seapp/SIGABRT check. No SELinux allow rule or kernel
change. Rollback by selecting the retained attempt55 profile/package.

